  "about.p2": "At the heart of the work is engaging with issues that often go unspoken in young men's everyday lives: violence, honour, masculinity, respect and belonging. In group meetings, participants reflect on their experiences, develop emotional skills and learn nonviolent conflict-resolution strategies.",
